\f1\fs22 \'93Now sell it!\'94 Alexander said as he back-pedalled and kept the others emerging from the stairwell in shot.\
Sarah emerged first, attended by Kathy, playing up the back-pain and likelihood she would give birth right there on the station floor. A pair of the gun-toters went to Sarah immediately and assisted her to a Traverse car. Kathy followed and joined. \
Next was Eloise with her shoes draping from one hand, and Hayley behind with her gun planted at the base of Eloise\'92s skull.\
\'93Look more defiant, mother,\'94 Alexander directed.\
\'93I\'92ll give you defiant, you overgrown tadpole,\'94 Eloise hissed.\
\'93Excellent!\'94 Alexander praised.\
Gun-toters surrounded Eloise and escorted her to the car.\
\'93Nice work, boys,\'94 Hayley said as she lowered her pistol. They all ignored her.\
\'93We better get to the next location, boss,\'94 Chip said to Alexander. \'93We\'92ve still got plenty of footage to shoot tonight if we\'92re to broadcast tomorrow.\'94\
\'93Right you are,\'94 Alexander answered and scurried to the Traverse car.\
\'93Excellent performance, gentlemen,\'94 Chip said. \'93I\'92ll get all your names from Ms Lanning for the credits.\'94\
One of the gun-toters lifted his hand to high-five Chip. Chip met the hand and almost broke the guy\'92s arm off at the elbow.
